/**
 * Zhengjia Lu - academic website, Research v2 (2026-10-07).
 * Expanded research portfolio: 3 papers, 11 projects, 3 conference contributions.
 * Contains the existing site's public pages, CSS, JavaScript, CV PDF and BibTeX.
 * No npm packages, credentials, database, filesystem writes or remote downloads.
 *
 * Render Web Service configuration (these comments do not create a service):
 *   Repository: https://github.com/LAZI123-lu/zhengjia-lu-academic-website
 *   Runtime: Node      Region: Oregon, USA      Plan: Free
 *   Build command: node --check server.js
 *   Start command: node server.js
 *   Health check: /healthz
 * Bind: 0.0.0.0 and process.env.PORT (defaults to 10000).
 * HTTPS is terminated by Render. Do not serve this port directly without TLS.
 *
 * The blocks below are gzip-compressed site assets, not executable remote code.
 * Editable content is supplied separately in Research-Source.zip (src/research.json).
 */
